(gradient). This is the backpropagation of the error.)","第层神经元的误差项是由第层的误差项乘以第层的权重，再乘以第层激活函数的导数（梯度）得到的。这就是误差的反向传播。"],"pictures":0,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":84,"kind":"backprop","title":"前向求值，反向求导","caption":"缓存中间结果，沿计算图反向传递误差信号","note":"参数共享或计算分支都会产生需要相加的梯度贡献。","url":"/diagrams/1/84.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":85,"part":"ppt/slides/slide85.xml","text":["Training Neural Networks","Back Propagation","Now that we have calculated the partial derivatives ,  and , then  and  can be represented as:"],"pictures":0,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":85,"kind":"backprop","title":"前向求值，反向求导","caption":"缓存中间结果，沿计算图反向传递误差信号","note":"参数共享或计算分支都会产生需要相加的梯度贡献。","url":"/diagrams/1/85.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":86,"part":"ppt/slides/slide86.xml","text":["Training Neural Networks","Back Propagation: An Example","Input sample: ","The parameters of the 1st layer:","The parameters of the 2nd layer:","The parameters of the 3rd layer:","Assuming all activation functions are Logistic functions:","Using the mean squared error as the loss function:"],"pictures":0,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":86,"kind":"backprop-example","title":"反向传播算例","caption":"沿三层网络计算输出、损失与参数梯度","note":"输入 (1,2)，各层使用 Sigmoid，目标标签为 1。","url":"/diagrams/1/86.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":87,"part":"ppt/slides/slide87.xml","text":["Training Neural Networks","Back Propagation: An Example","First, initialize the parameters of the neural network and calculate the first layer of neurons:"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":87,"kind":"backprop-example","title":"反向传播算例","caption":"沿三层网络计算输出、损失与参数梯度","note":"输入 (1,2)，各层使用 Sigmoid，目标标签为 1。","url":"/diagrams/1/87.svg","sourceElements":[]}},{"page":88,"part":"ppt/slides/slide88.xml","text":["Training Neural Networks","Back Propagation: An Example","Similarly:"],"pictures":1,"hidden":false,"media":[],"links":[],"figure":{"page":88,"kind":"backprop-example","title":